@startuml
title ZK Governance Vote Flow

actor Voter
participant "Wallet dApp" as WAL
participant "ZK Prover" as PROVER
participant "Governance Module" as GOV
participant "Nullifier Registry" as NULL
participant "Proposal Store" as PROP

Voter -> WAL: Select proposal & vote option
WAL -> PROVER: Request attested vote proof
PROVER -> PROVER: Build SNARK (identity, stake, choice)
PROVER --> WAL: Proof + nullifier
WAL -> GOV: MsgSubmitZKVote(proof,nullifier,choice)
GOV -> NULL: Check nullifier unused
NULL --> GOV: ok / reject
GOV -> GOV: Verify zk proof & stake commitment
GOV -> PROP: Append encrypted vote payload
GOV -> NULL: Mark nullifier consumed
PROP --> WAL: Emit VoteAccepted event

@enduml
